@startuml
participant Solo
participant Peer
Solo -> Peer : predecessor is message
/rnote right of Peer
slash after message must stand alone
end rnote
Peer -> Solo : reset predecessor to message
/ note right of Peer
slash after second message also stands alone
end note
note right of Peer
base mergeable folded note
end note
/ hnote right of Peer
merge only after a note predecessor
end hnote
@enduml
